WEBVTT

00:01:41.185 --> 00:01:43.145
(SEAGULLS SQUAWKING)

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.571
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:02:11.423 --> 00:02:15.094
Dougal, settle down now, please.

00:02:15.386 --> 00:02:16.387
(DOUGAL GRUMBLES)

00:02:16.554 --> 00:02:17.805
It won't be long.

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:37.199
CUSTOMS OFFICIAL: Next.

00:02:43.747 --> 00:02:46.083
-British, huh?
-Yes.

00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:48.294
-First trip to New York?
-Yes.

00:02:49.545 --> 00:02:50.629
Anything edible in there?

00:02:51.213 --> 00:02:52.214
No.

00:02:53.966 --> 00:02:55.009
Livestock?

00:03:00.472 --> 00:03:03.017
Must get that fixed. Um... No.

00:03:04.435 --> 00:03:05.436
Let me take a look.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.442
MUGGLE
WORTHY

00:03:24.413 --> 00:03:25.414
(WATCH TICKING)

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:30.377
Welcome to New York.

00:03:30.544 --> 00:03:31.629
Thank you.

00:03:31.962 --> 00:03:32.963
Next.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.053
WITNESS: And it was like a... Like a wind.

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:41.931
Or like a... Like a ghost.

00:03:42.097 --> 00:03:43.140
But dark.

00:03:44.642 --> 00:03:46.101
And I saw its eyes.

00:03:47.603 --> 00:03:49.229
Shining white eyes.

00:03:52.816 --> 00:03:55.152
A dark wind, with eyes?

00:03:55.361 --> 00:03:56.987
It's like a dark mass.

00:03:58.197 --> 00:04:01.492
And it dove down there. Down underground.

00:04:01.951 --> 00:04:04.370
Someone ought to do something about it.

00:04:04.912 --> 00:04:07.831
It's everywhere, this thing.
It's out of control.

00:04:09.667 --> 00:04:11.877
Hey, you get anything?

00:04:12.336 --> 00:04:14.546
REPORTER: Dark wind. Blah, blah.

00:04:15.005 --> 00:04:17.383
PHOTOGRAPHER: Some sorta
atmospheric hooey. Or electrical.

00:04:19.134 --> 00:04:20.260
REPORTER: Hey, you thirsty?

00:04:20.552 --> 00:04:24.181
No. I'm on the wagon.
Promised Martha I'd lay off.

00:04:24.556 --> 00:04:26.475
(HISSING)

00:04:27.476 --> 00:04:29.561
-PHOTOGRAPHER: It's atmospheric.
-(WALL CRACKING)

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.168
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:05:06.265 --> 00:05:08.517
Out of the way, folks. Coming through!

00:05:08.684 --> 00:05:13.439
MARY LOU: This great city sparkles
with the jewels of man's inventions.

00:05:13.605 --> 00:05:15.941
Movie theaters, automobiles,

00:05:16.108 --> 00:05:18.694
the wireless, electric lights,

00:05:18.902 --> 00:05:21.739
-all dazzle and bewitch us.
-I'm so sorry.

00:05:22.031 --> 00:05:25.617
But where there is light,
there is shadow, friend.

00:05:26.035 --> 00:05:28.537
Something is stalking our city,

00:05:28.829 --> 00:05:32.249
wreaking destruction, and then
disappearing without a trace!

00:05:34.918 --> 00:05:36.086
We have to fight.

00:05:36.837 --> 00:05:40.549
Join us, the Second Salemers,
in our fight.

00:05:40.716 --> 00:05:43.552
Excuse me, doll.
Just trying to get to the bank.

00:05:43.719 --> 00:05:44.720
MARY LOU: We have to fight together

00:05:44.887 --> 00:05:46.013
-for the sake of our--
-Excuse me--

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:47.306
MAN: Hey! Watch it!

00:05:47.473 --> 00:05:49.475
So sorry. My case.

00:05:50.934 --> 00:05:52.061
(EXHALES) No harm done.

00:05:52.936 --> 00:05:54.188
(GRUNTS) Excuse me.

00:05:54.354 --> 00:05:55.564
You!

00:05:56.106 --> 00:05:57.107
Friend.

00:06:00.486 --> 00:06:02.446
What drew you to our meeting today?

00:06:03.322 --> 00:06:04.907
Oh, I was just passing.

00:06:05.074 --> 00:06:06.408
Are you a seeker?

00:06:07.034 --> 00:06:08.660
A seeker after truth?

00:06:10.454 --> 00:06:12.456
NEWT: I'm more of a chaser, really.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.043
MARY LOU: Hear my words.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.628
And heed my warning.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:19.088
(RUSTLING)

00:06:19.505 --> 00:06:21.465
And laugh if you dare.

00:06:23.801 --> 00:06:25.886
Witches live among us.

00:06:26.512 --> 00:06:29.515
We have to fight together
for the sake of our children.

00:06:29.681 --> 00:06:31.475
For the sake of tomorrow.

00:06:31.767 --> 00:06:33.018
What do you say to that, friend?

00:06:38.816 --> 00:06:39.942
(SNIFFING)

00:06:44.154 --> 00:06:45.155
Excuse me.

